        "question_type": "Theory",
        "exam_year": "2022",
        "question_text": "<p>(a) Copy and complete the table of values for y = 3Sinx + 7Cosx for 0&deg;</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:500px\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>x&ordm;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>0</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>20</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>40</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>60</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>80</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>100</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>120</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>140</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>160</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>180</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>y</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>7.0</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>4.2</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>-0.9</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(b) Using a scale of 2cm to 20&deg; on the x-axis and 2cm to 2 units on the y-axis, draw the graph of y = 3Sinx + 7Cosx for&nbsp;0&deg;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(c) Using the graph, find the;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(i) value of y when x= 150&deg;,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(i) range of values of x for which y &gt; 0.</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:500px\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>x&ordm;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>0</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>20</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>40</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>60</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>80</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>100</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>120</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>140</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>160</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>180</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>y</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>7.0</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>7.6</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>7.3</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>6.1</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>4.2</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>1.7</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>-0.9</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>-3.4</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>-5.6</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>7.0</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(b)</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"Open photo\" src=\"https://scontent.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t1.15752-9/328166333_5965944483520046_777300125532418252_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s206x206&amp;_nc_cat=107&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=aee45a&amp;_nc_eui2=AeFXxU4Vy9GAVP7Xhrwrzs3Dwz_WAks7657DP9YCSzvrnr4zaa08tpzm4tLUW1biLdW-n89Nl12jrUX79KBvubLI&amp;_nc_ohc=Q-iYDDpwWaIAX_W0xEZ&amp;_nc_oc=AQkPsZ-pTnFNV7PrqSJ9ebSi7N4u6bTxvpz0jzhYzIoI15ENW17OmBpGCPD6tH4YSUqKlhPoFD0PiJIJoVEuCySw&amp;_nc_ad=z-m&amp;_nc_cid=0&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.xx&amp;oh=03_AdQzFwYo3BEDuRaXjqdRPyzKrXrWvChl37RhDTL-xvQXhw&amp;oe=63FE320E\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>(C)(i) From the graph, When x is 150&deg; y = -4.6 <em>&plusmn;</em> 0.2</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(ii) Range of value of x for which y &gt; is x: 0&ordm;&nbsp;&le; x&nbsp;&le; 113</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
