    "65868": {
        "order_id": 10,
        "exam_type": "WAEC",
        "subject": "Mathematics",
        "topic": "statistics",
        "question_type": "Theory",
        "exam_year": "2022",
        "question_text": "<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:200px\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Age</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>3</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>4</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>5</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>6</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>7</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>8</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>9</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>10</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>No. of children</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>2</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>6</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>5</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>x</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>6</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>9</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>8</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>5</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>The table shows the distribution of ages of a number of children in a school. If the mean of the distribution is 7, find the;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(a) value of x, (b) standard deviation of their ages.</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>Mean =&nbsp; \\(\\frac{\\sum fx}{ \\sum f}\\) =&nbsp;&nbsp;(3x2) +(4x6) + (5x5) +&nbsp;(6x) + (7x6) + (8x9) + (9x8) + (10x5)&nbsp; &divide;&nbsp;(2 + 6 + 5 + x + 6 + 9 + 8 + 5)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>7 = (291 + 6x)&nbsp;&divide; (41+x)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>7(41+x) = 291 + 6x</p>\r\n\r\n<p>287 + 7x = 291 + 6x</p>\r\n\r\n<p>x = 4</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(b)</p>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width:400px\">\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Age(x in yrs)</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>No.of child</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Fx\\(^2\\)</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>3</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>2</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>18</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>4</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>6</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>96</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>5</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>5</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>125</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>6</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>4</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>144</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>7</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>6</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>294</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>8</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>9</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>576</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>9</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>8</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>648</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>10</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>5</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>500</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>&Sigma;f = 45</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>\r\n\t\t\t<p>&Sigma;fx\\(^2\\) = 2401&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t\t\t</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>Standard deviation = \\(\\sqrt \\frac{196}{45}&nbsp;= \\sqrt 4.3555\\)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 2.087</p>",
        "reference_passage": null,
        "novel": null,
        "comments_count": 5,
        "options": [],
        "_page_num": 2,
        "_page_idx": 4,
        "editor_images": null
    },
    "65869": {
        "order_id": 11,
        "exam_type": "WAEC",
        "subject": "Mathematics",
        "topic": "triangles-and-polygons",
        "question_type": "Theory",
        "exam_year": "2022",
        "question_text": "<p>(a)&nbsp;In the diagram,&nbsp;O is the centre of the circle XYZ. angle&nbsp;ZXO=34&nbsp;&deg; and angle&nbsp;XOY=146&nbsp;&deg; . Find angle OYZ.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(b) The exterior angles of a polygon are 42, 38,57, x, (x+ y)&deg;. (2x- 15)&deg; and (3x -y)&ordm;? If x is 7 less than y, find the values of x and y.</p>",
        "question_image": "nigeria/exam_image/question_image/WAEC/Mathematics/year/Theory/2022/img_65869.webp",
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>(a)&nbsp;&ang;XYZ = \\(\\frac{1}{2}\\)&nbsp;(146) = 73&ordm;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ang;OZX = 34&ordm;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ang;OZY = 73 - 34</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&ang;OYZ =&nbsp;&ang;OZY&nbsp;= 39&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>(b) x = y - 7</p>\r\n\r\n<p>42 + 38 + 57 + x + x +&nbsp;y + 2x - 15 + 3x - y = 360</p>\r\n\r\n<p>122&deg;+7x = 360&deg;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>7x = 360&ordm; - 122 =&nbsp;&nbsp;238&deg;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>7x = 238&ordm;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>x = 34</p>\r\n\r\n<p>: 34 = y - 7</p>\r\n\r\n<p>34 + 7 = y</p>\r\n\r\n<p>41 = y</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "reference_passage": null,
        "novel": null,
